# User-added snaps only. Baseline Ubuntu snaps are intentionally NOT listed so a
# server target doesn't pull the desktop set; snapd auto-installs any base snap
# (core*, bare) a listed snap depends on.
#
# Dropped as baseline (re-add here if you actually want them on a fresh box):
#   bare core22 core24 snapd                      — base/runtime snaps
#   canonical-livepatch                           — Ubuntu Pro system service
#   firefox thunderbird snap-store                — default desktop apps
#   gnome-46-2404 gtk-common-themes mesa-2404     — desktop platform/themes
#   desktop-security-center prompting-client snapd-desktop-integration — desktop/snapd UI
#
# Note: inventory-export.sh regenerates this file from live state and WILL
# re-add the baseline snaps; re-trim after exporting.
alacritty
